{%- doc -%}
  Bespoke hub/routing page for the "Tous les accessoires" collection
  (handle: tous-les-accessoires) — the page a visitor lands on from the
  nav's "Accessoires" entry without picking a specific range first.

  Deliberately NOT a product grid, unlike its three sibling pages
  (collection-vigilia-touch-shop / -elite-shop / -key-shop). This
  collection mixes 52 products across three mutually INCOMPATIBLE alarm
  ecosystems (Vigilia/Touch AM30x, Élite PA501Z, Key SA501) — showing
  them together risks a customer adding an accessory that won't work
  with their actual system. So the job here is routing (pick your
  system, then land on the right shop page) plus general education
  (what do these accessory types even do), not browsing/buying — no
  add-to-cart, no quantity steppers, no JS filtering, no cart-drawer
  wiring. Static page, on purpose.

  v3 design pass: the previous version (light throughout, navy/green
  only, thin white cards) read as too thin/safe — merchant asked for
  something more premium AND more colorful. This version commits to a
  deep near-black hero + system-selector canvas with soft multi-color
  glow (the "aurora" treatment premium SaaS products use — Stripe,
  Linear, etc. — genuinely apt here since it reads as "colorful AND
  premium" at once, not one traded for the other), and gives each of
  the three systems its OWN accent color instead of one uniform
  treatment: Vigilia/Touch → electric blue (digital/touchscreen), Élite
  → emerald (Zigbee/connected), Key → warm gold (classic/reliable).
  That's where "more colorful" actually comes from — three distinct,
  confident colors, each used tastefully within a controlled dark
  palette, rather than a wash of many colors at low conviction.

  The zone-map SVG signature from v2 is kept (merchant didn't object to
  it, and it's still the most grounded image for "a hub that watches
  multiple zones") but now glows, and its five sensor dots cycle through
  the three new accent colors — a visual preview of the colorful system
  cards below it.

  The glossary section is kept close to v2's structure/copy per explicit
  feedback ("la partie explicative est à peu près ok") — light section,
  same decomposed tags — but restyled to sit cleanly after a much bolder
  dark hero/selector, which is itself a deliberate premium page rhythm
  (bold statement, then a calmer detail section) rather than an
  inconsistency.

  Prefixed `hub-` (distinct from the shop pages' `das-`/`vts-`).
{%- enddoc -%}

<div id="shopify-section-{{ section.id }}" class="hub">
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .hub{
      --hub-bg-deep:#060b1a;
      --hub-bg-navy:#0c1e4a;
      --hub-navy-deep:#071228;
      --hub-ink:#171b23;
      --hub-gray:#5b6270;
      --hub-paper:#f7f8fb;
      --hub-line:#e2e6ee;
      --hub-mist:rgba(255,255,255,.68);
      --hub-mist-soft:rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      --hub-brand-green:#037e05;
      --hub-blue:#3b82f6;
      --hub-blue-glow:#60a5fa;
      --hub-emerald:#10b981;
      --hub-emerald-glow:#34d399;
      --hub-gold:#f59e0b;
      --hub-gold-glow:#fbbf24;
      --hub-mono:'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
      color:var(--hub-ink);
      background:#fff;
    }
    .hub *{box-sizing:border-box;}
    .hub .hub-wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
    .hub svg{display:block;}

    /* ---- dark canvas: hero + system selector share one bold surface ---- */
    .hub-dark{
      position:relative;overflow:hidden;
      background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 15% 0%, rgba(59,130,246,.22), transparent 60%),
                 radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 85% 15%, rgba(16,185,129,.20), transparent 60%),
                 radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at 50% 100%, rgba(245,158,11,.14), transparent 60%),
                 var(--hub-bg-deep);
    }
    .hub-dark::before{
      content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;
      background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.07) 1.2px, transparent 1.2px);
      background-size:28px 28px;
      -webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 65% 55% at 50% 15%, #000 30%, transparent 100%);
      mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 65% 55% at 50% 15%, #000 30%, transparent 100%);
    }

    /* ---- hero ---- */
    .hub-hero{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:72px 0 40px;}
    .hub-hero__inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;}
    @media (min-width:900px){.hub-hero__inner{grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:24px;}}
    .hub-hero__text{text-align:center;}
    @media (min-width:900px){.hub-hero__text{text-align:left;}}
    .hub-eyebrow{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
      font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--hub-gold-glow);margin-bottom:18px;
    }
    .hub-eyebrow::before{content:"";width:14px;height:2px;background:var(--hub-gold-glow);}
    .hub-hero h1{
      font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.08;margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px);max-width:560px;color:#fff;
    }
    .hub-hero__sub{
      font-size:clamp(15px,1.6vw,17px);color:var(--hub-mist);
      max-width:520px;margin:20px auto 0;line-height:1.65;
    }
    @media (min-width:900px){.hub-hero__sub{margin:20px 0 0;}}
    .hub-hero__badge{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-top:24px;
      font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid var(--hub-mist-soft);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
      border-radius:999px;padding:9px 18px;
    }
    .hub-hero__badge svg{color:var(--hub-emerald-glow);flex-shrink:0;}

    /* ---- zone-map graphic (signature) ---- */
    .hub-map{width:100%;max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;}
    @media (min-width:900px){.hub-map{margin:0;}}
    .hub-map svg{width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible;}
    .hub-map__room{fill:rgba(255,255,255,.03);stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.14);stroke-width:1.6;}
    .hub-map__link{stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.16);stroke-width:1.6;stroke-dasharray:3 5;fill:none;}
    .hub-map__sensor--blue{fill:var(--hub-blue-glow);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(96,165,250,.85));}
    .hub-map__sensor--emerald{fill:var(--hub-emerald-glow);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(52,211,153,.85));}
    .hub-map__sensor--gold{fill:var(--hub-gold-glow);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(251,191,36,.85));}
    .hub-map__hub-ring{fill:none;stroke:var(--hub-emerald-glow);stroke-width:1.4;opacity:.4;transform-origin:210px 190px;animation:hub-ring 2.6s ease-out infinite;}
    .hub-map__hub{fill:#fff;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 14px rgba(255,255,255,.35));}
    .hub-map__hub-icon{stroke:var(--hub-bg-deep);stroke-width:1.7;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}
    @keyframes hub-ring{
      0%{transform:scale(.72);opacity:.55;}
      100%{transform:scale(1.2);opacity:0;}
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.hub-map__hub-ring{animation:none;opacity:.28;}}

    /* ---- system selector ---- */
    .hub-systems{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:24px 0 88px;}
    .hub-systems__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;}
    @media (min-width:820px){.hub-systems__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;}}

    .hub-system{
      position:relative;overflow:hidden;
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;text-decoration:none;
      border-radius:22px;padding:30px 26px 26px;
      background:linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(255,255,255,.07), rgba(255,255,255,.02));
      border:1px solid var(--hub-mist-soft);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
      transition:box-shadow .25s ease,transform .25s ease,border-color .25s ease,background .25s ease;
    }
    .hub-system::before{
      content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;
      transition:opacity .25s ease;opacity:.85;
    }
    .hub-system--blue::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--hub-blue),var(--hub-blue-glow));}
    .hub-system--emerald::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--hub-emerald),var(--hub-emerald-glow));}
    .hub-system--gold::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--hub-gold),var(--hub-gold-glow));}
    .hub-system:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);background:linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(255,255,255,.1), rgba(255,255,255,.03));}
    .hub-system--blue:hover{border-color:rgba(96,165,250,.5);box-shadow:0 24px 48px -24px rgba(59,130,246,.45);}
    .hub-system--emerald:hover{border-color:rgba(52,211,153,.5);box-shadow:0 24px 48px -24px rgba(16,185,129,.45);}
    .hub-system--gold:hover{border-color:rgba(251,191,36,.5);box-shadow:0 24px 48px -24px rgba(245,158,11,.45);}

    .hub-system__top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;}
    .hub-system__icon{
      width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;color:#fff;
    }
    .hub-system--blue .hub-system__icon{background:linear-gradient(150deg,var(--hub-blue),#1d4ed8);}
    .hub-system--emerald .hub-system__icon{background:linear-gradient(150deg,var(--hub-emerald),#047857);}
    .hub-system--gold .hub-system__icon{background:linear-gradient(150deg,var(--hub-gold),#b45309);}
    .hub-system__status{
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:var(--hub-mono);
      font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hub-mist);
      margin-top:4px;
    }
    .hub-system__dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;}
    .hub-system--blue .hub-system__dot{background:var(--hub-blue-glow);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--hub-blue-glow);}
    .hub-system--emerald .hub-system__dot{background:var(--hub-emerald-glow);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--hub-emerald-glow);}
    .hub-system--gold .hub-system__dot{background:var(--hub-gold-glow);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--hub-gold-glow);}

    .hub-system__code{font-family:var(--hub-mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em;}
    .hub-system--blue .hub-system__code{color:var(--hub-blue-glow);}
    .hub-system--emerald .hub-system__code{color:var(--hub-emerald-glow);}
    .hub-system--gold .hub-system__code{color:var(--hub-gold-glow);}

    .hub-system__name{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;}
    .hub-system__desc{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--hub-mist);flex:1;}
    .hub-system__chip{
      align-self:flex-start;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid var(--hub-mist-soft);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px;
    }
    .hub-system__cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:4px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;}
    .hub-system--blue .hub-system__cta{color:var(--hub-blue-glow);}
    .hub-system--emerald .hub-system__cta{color:var(--hub-emerald-glow);}
    .hub-system--gold .hub-system__cta{color:var(--hub-gold-glow);}
    .hub-system__cta svg{transition:transform .2s ease;}
    .hub-system:hover .hub-system__cta svg{transform:translateX(3px);}

    /* ---- glossary (kept close to v2, per feedback) ---- */
    .hub-glossary{padding:64px 0 76px;background:var(--hub-paper);}
    .hub-glossary__head{text-align:center;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 40px;}
    .hub-glossary__head h2{
      font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,28px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--hub-navy-deep);margin:0 0 10px;
    }
    .hub-glossary__head p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--hub-gray);line-height:1.6;margin:0;}

    .hub-glossary__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;}
    @media (min-width:700px){.hub-glossary__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;}}
    @media (min-width:1020px){.hub-glossary__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}

    .hub-term{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;}
    .hub-term__icon{
      width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--hub-paper);
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--hub-bg-navy);margin-bottom:14px;
    }
    .hub-term__name{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--hub-ink);margin:0 0 6px;}
    .hub-term__desc{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--hub-gray);margin:0 0 12px;}
    .hub-term__tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;}
    .hub-term__tag{
      font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hub-bg-navy);
      background:var(--hub-paper);border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;
    }

    .hub-note{
      display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;max-width:820px;margin:32px auto 0;
      padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid var(--hub-gold);border-radius:10px;
    }
    .hub-note svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;color:#9a6a00;}
    .hub-note p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--hub-ink);}

    .hub-system:focus-visible,.hub-system__cta:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:3px;}

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
      .hub-system{transition:none;}
      .hub-system::before{transition:none;}
      .hub-system__cta svg{transition:none;}
    }
  </style>

  <div class="hub-dark">
